  "description": "The Forklift Hoist is designed to handle impressive weight capacity of up to 5500 LB, reducing stress on your machinery. Lift heavy materials with ease using this powerful Jib Boom Crane.\nFitment\nMade from heavy-duty steel with a thickness of 0.5\", this crane attachment is built to withstand professional construction and industrial jobs. It is a durable piece of hardware that can handle tough tasks.\nFeatures\nGREAT FOR LIFTING HEAVY LOADS: Dont strain and tax your equipment trying to lift heavy loads. Its designed to take stress off your machinery by supporting an impressive weight capacity of up to 5500 lbs. Pick up hefty materials using this powerful piece of equipment.\nEASY TO INSTALL: Choose the right length and lifting capacity to lift heavy objects in a variety of different scenarios.\nDURABLE CONSTRUCTION: The steel thickness of this attachment is 0.5 inches. This crane attachment is made of heavy-duty steel to easily handle professional construction and industrial jobs.\nRUST RESISTANT COATING: All steel design plus yellow rust-resistant coated finishing prevents rusting for continued use throughout the seasons.\nDIMENSIONS: Weighing 155 LB, this Jib Boom measures 31\" long and telescopes to 79\". The hooks position from 47.25\" to 77\". This attachment has an overall width of 19.5\". The inside fork pocket measures 6.75\" x 2.25\"",
